/ Propshaft has no require_tree, so every stylesheet is linked explicitly, in the order
  Sprockets used to concatenate them: trix and actiontext first, tailwind last.
  The app_shell layout (new design) skips legacy.css: its unlayered rules override Tailwind utilities.
- stylesheets = local_assigns.fetch(:legacy_css, true) ? %w[trix actiontext legacy application tailwind] : %w[trix actiontext application tailwind]
= stylesheet_link_tag(*stylesheets, "data-turbo-track": "reload")

